    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Rage in Ecstatic Union with a God</p></blockquote><p>Barbarians who walk the Path of the Zealot receive gifts from a god or a pantheon. They experience their Rage as an ecstatic union with the divine that fills them with power, and they are often allies of their god's priests and followers.</p><h3>Path of the Zealot Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.hL5p4s7HrXT3RJZO]{Divine Fury}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.EF0Lo0GISZhelpgn]{Warrior of the Gods}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.KZdBRJpeDfFqTrmC]{Fanatical Focus}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.PkwcDd4tfLZizAES]{Zealous Presence}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.H1X4absfUebBFHXS]{Rage of the Gods}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
